The compiled implementation also emits `CW-JVM stage 1` through `CW-JVM stage 6`
around JVM creation, class-loader hook installation, argument conversion, and the
call to the Java main method. The patch is intentionally kept as a small delta;
the third-party launcher source is not copied into CWLauncher.
